# Evaluation reports are generated artifacts (Phase 17 policy): every
# `python evaluate.py` run writes a new timestamped report, and timestamped
# runs are not committed. Golden datasets under eval/golden_sets/ stay
# version-controlled; reports tracked before Phase 17 remain tracked as
# historical evidence.
eval/reports/*

